#: src/Settings/PlaybackPage.qml:107
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Hardware decoding"
msgstr "Hardware bidezko deskodetzea"

#: src/Settings/PlaybackPage.qml:149
msgctxt "@info:tooltip hardware decoding setting"
msgid ""
"Specify the hardware video decoding API that should be used if possible. "
"Whether hardware decoding is actually done depends on the video codec. If "
"hardware decoding is not possible, mpv will fall back on software decoding."
"<br><br><ul><li><strong>auto</strong> tries to automatically enable hardware "
"decoding using the first available method.</li><li><strong>auto-safe</"
"strong> similar to auto, but allows only whitelisted methods that are "
"considered “safe”.</li><li><strong>vaapi</strong> works with Intel and AMD "
"GPUs only. It also requires the opengl EGL backend.</li><li><strong>nvdec</"
"strong> the newest, and recommended method to do hardware decoding on Nvidia "
"GPUs.</li><li><strong>cuda</strong> an older implementation of hardware "
"decoding on Nvidia GPUs.</li><li><strong>videotoolbox</strong></"
"li><li><strong>d3d11va</strong></li></ul><br><br>You can read more about "
"hardware decoding here: <a href='https://mpv.io/manual/stable/#options-"
"hwdec'>https://mpv.io/manual/stable/#options-hwdec</a><br><br>You can set "
"another hardware decoder by creating a startup custom command <strong>set "
"hwdec <i>decoder_name</i></strong>."
msgstr ""
"Ahal bada, zehaztu bideoa deskodetzeko  erabili beharko litzatekeen hardware "
"APIa. Hardeware bidez benetan deskodetzen den bideo kodeken araberakoa da. "
"Hardware bidez deskodetzea posible ez bada, mpv software bidez deskodetzera "
"joko du.<br><br><ul><li><strong>auto</strong> lehenengo metodo erabilgarria "
"erabiliz hardware bidez deskodetzea automatikoki gaitzen saiatzen da.</"
"li><li><strong>auto-safe</strong> auto-ren antzekoa, baina zerrenda-zurian "
"ipinitako, “segurutzat” jotzen diren metodoak bakarrik baimentzen ditu.</"
"li><li><strong>vaapi</strong> Intel eta AMD GPUekin bakarrik dabil. OpenGL "
"EGL bizkarraldekoa ere behar du. </li><li><strong>nvdec</strong> berriena, "
"eta Nvidia GPUetan hardware bidez deskodetzeko metodo gomendatua.</"
"li><li><strong>cuda</strong>Nvidia GPUetan hardware bidez deskodetzeko "
"inplementazio zaharrago bat.</li><li><strong>videotoolbox </strong></"
"li><li><strong>d3d11va</strong></li></ul><br><br>Hardware bidez "
"deskodetzeari buruz gehiago irakurri dezakezu hemen: <a href='https://mpv.io/"
"manual/stable/#options-hwdec'>https://mpv.io/manual/stable/#options-hwdec</"
"a><br><br>Neurrira ipinitako abioko komando bat sortuz beste hardware "
"deskodetzaile bat ezar dezakezu <strong>set hwdec <i>decoder_name</i></"
"strong>."

